{"ops":[{"insert":"可折叠卡片组件"},{"attributes":{"header":1},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"组件效果"},{"attributes":{"header":1},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":{"image":"data:image/png;base64,"}},{"insert":"\n基本用途"},{"attributes":{"header":1},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"这是一个基于 Vue 3 Composition API 的可折叠卡片组件，主要用于展示可展开/收起的内容区域，常见于后台管理系统、设置面板等需要组织内容的场景。\n\n主要功能"},{"attributes":{"header":1},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"1. **折叠/展开功能**：点击标题栏可以切换内容的显示/隐藏状态\n2. **动画效果**：使用 `BKCollapseTransition` 组件实现平滑的展开/收起动画\n3. **插槽支持**：\n   - `title` 插槽：用于自定义标题内容\n   - 默认插槽：用于放置卡片主体内容\n4. **视觉指示器**：包含一个向下箭头图标，会根据折叠状态旋转\n5. **样式美化**：提供卡片式的外观设计，包括阴影、圆角和间距\n\n基本用法"},{"attributes":{"header":1},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"\n"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"plain"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"<template>"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"  <CollapseCard>"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"    <!-- 默认插槽内容 -->"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"    <p>这里是卡片内容，可以展开或收起</p>"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"  </CollapseCard>"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"</template>"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n\n"},{"insert":"<script setup>"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"import CollapseCard from './CollapseCard.vue'"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"</script>"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n\n"},{"insert":"\n使用标题插槽"},{"attributes":{"header":1},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"\n"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"plain"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"<template>"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"  <CollapseCard>"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"    <!-- title 插槽自定义标题 -->"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"    <template #title>"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"      <span>自定义标题</span>"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"plain"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"    </template>"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"    "},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"    <!-- 默认插槽内容 -->"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"    <p>这里是卡片内容</p>"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"  </CollapseCard>"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"</template>"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n\n"},{"insert":"\n多个卡片组合"},{"attributes":{"header":1},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"\n"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"plain"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"<template>"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"  <CollapseCard>"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"    <template #title>卡片1</template>"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"    <p>内容1</p>"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"  </CollapseCard>"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"  "},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"  <CollapseCard>"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"    <template #title>卡片2</template>"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"    <p>内容2</p>"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"  </CollapseCard>"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"</template>"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n\n"},{"insert":"\n技术细节"},{"attributes":{"header":1},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"- 使用 Vue 3 的 `<script setup>` 语法\n- 使用 Composition API 的 `ref` 管理折叠状态\n- 通过 `v-show` 和 `BKCollapseTransition` 实现动画效果\n- 样式使用 Less 预处理器编写，采用 scoped 限定作用域\n- 依赖了 `bkui-vue` 库中的 `BKCollapseTransition` 组件和 `DbIcon` 图标组件\n\n样式特点"},{"attributes":{"header":1},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"- 卡片默认有白色背景、轻微阴影和 2px 圆角\n- 相邻卡片之间有 16px 的上边距\n- 标题栏有鼠标指针样式，表明可点击\n- 箭头图标初始为向下 90 度旋转，展开时恢复为 0 度\n\n该组件设计简洁，易于集成到现有项目中，特别适合需要组织大量内容并希望节省空间的应用场景。\n"}]}